C ELM38A              CONDITIONS RELATED TO PLOTTING
C
C PLOT       TRUE IF PLOT IS TO BE MADE
C LPLOT      IF PLOT IS AGAINST ACCUMULATED LENGTH
C PLNOW      IF PLOT IS BEING MADE
C NPLT       NUMBER OF ITEMS IN PLOT FILE
C EPLOT(10)  IF BEAM DIMENSION IS BEING PLOTTED
C
      INTEGER         NPLT
      LOGICAL         PLOT, LPLOT, PLNOW, EPLOT(10)
C
      COMMON /ELM38A/ PLOT, LPLOT, PLNOW, NPLT, EPLOT
